    "category": "Non-automatic weighing instrument",
    "type_designations": ["XT Series", "XT 100", "XT 101", "XT 200", "XT 300", "XT 400", "XT 410", "XT 420"],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "The Avery Berkel XT Series non-automatic weighing instruments are mains-powered, Class III, price-computing, stand-alone instruments intended for direct sales to the public. Maximum capacities are between 6 kg and 30 kg. Features include a vendor's TFT WVGA colour touch-screen display/keyboard, customer TFT WVGA colour displays (some tower mounted), cassette printer using thermal print head, die-cast chassis and plastic housing containing the load cell and electronics, stainless steel load receptor, and a level indicator (traditional bubble or software-based). Interfaces: Ethernet, USB, DVI."
